<title>USA: Jaclyn Inc Year profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Jaclyn Inc Year profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WEST NEW YORK, N.J. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>JACLYN, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>		     For the Fiscal Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			     With comparisons to 1995</p>
<p>							   Year Ended</p>
<p>							     June 30</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Revenues				   $72,640,000   $73,894,000</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) before income taxes  1,142,000  (3,883,000)*</p>
<p> Provision (benefit) for income taxes   457,000   (1,563,000)</p>
<p> Net Earnings (loss)			  685,000   (2,320,000)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per</p>
<p> Common Share					 .25	 (.86)**</p>
<p>Average Number of</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding			 2,691,405     2,691,352</p>
<p>*Includes a pre-tax charge of $995,000 and expenses of $1,761,000, primarily for the write-down of inventory both in connection with the Company's fiscal 1995 restructuring.</p>
<p>**Includes an after-tax loss of $.62 per share for the restructuring and other costs previously mentioned.</p>
